<section class="document-page">
<h1>Customer relationship profile</h1><p class="sandbox-label"><strong>Sandbox specimen</strong> · Fictional institution and customer data.</p><p class="document-reference">${facts.documentReference} · ${facts.issuedOn}</p>
<dl class="key-details"><div><dt>Customer</dt><dd>${facts.partyName}</dd></div><div><dt>Customer reference</dt><dd>${facts.partyReference}</dd></div><div><dt>Customer type</dt><dd>Individual</dd></div><div><dt>Relationship since</dt><dd>${facts.relationshipSince}</dd></div><div><dt>Snapshot as of</dt><dd>${facts.asOf}</dd></div><div><dt>Use purpose</dt><dd>Internal customer service</dd></div><div><dt>Residency country key</dt><dd>${facts.residencyCountry}</dd></div><div><dt>Preferred language</dt><dd>${facts.preferredLanguage}</dd></div><div><dt>Masked contact</dt><dd>${facts.maskedContact}</dd></div><div><dt>Review record</dt><dd>${facts.reviewReference}</dd></div><div><dt>Last recorded review</dt><dd>${facts.lastReviewDate}</dd></div><div><dt>Review due</dt><dd>${facts.reviewDueDate}</dd></div></dl><h2>Relationship summary</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Product</th><th scope="col">Reference</th><th scope="col">Role / state</th></tr></thead><tbody><#list facts.relationships as row><tr><td>${row.productName}</td><td>${row.reference}</td><td><#if row.role == "HOLDER">Account holder<#else>Authorized representative</#if> / ${row.status}</td></tr></#list></tbody></table>
<div class="document-legal-note"><strong>Demonstration document.</strong> Firefly Sandbox Financial Services is a fictional demonstration entity. This is an unsigned sandbox specimen with fictional data, not an approved customer form, legal certification, audited report, signature or payment evidence. Approved institution details, source facts, product terms and jurisdiction wording require their own governed revision and authorization.</div>
</section>
<section class="document-page">
<h2>Review, privacy, and source notes</h2><p class="sandbox-label"><strong>Sandbox specimen</strong> · Fictional institution and customer data.</p><p class="document-reference">${facts.documentReference} · ${facts.issuedOn}</p>
<h2>Review and permitted use</h2><p>Recorded review state: Review recorded. This profile summarizes supplied customer and review snapshots for the stated internal purpose. It does not independently verify identity, complete KYC, establish creditworthiness, grant entitlements or certify an account’s legal ownership. Consult the actual owning workflow and its current evidence before acting.</p><p>Privacy/consent reference: ${facts.consentReference}. Access and disclosure require current purpose-specific authorization. The example deliberately omits full identification numbers, authentication data, detailed screening evidence and unmasked personal contact data. A customer-facing profile requires its own approved disclosure and data-minimization policy. Correction requests use ${facts.serviceReference}.</p><h2>Referenced records</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Snapshot</th><th scope="col">Version</th></tr></thead><tbody><#list facts.sources as row><tr><td>${row.resourceReference}</td><td>${row.version}</td></tr></#list></tbody></table>

<div class="document-legal-note"><strong>Demonstration document.</strong> Firefly Sandbox Financial Services is a fictional demonstration entity. This is an unsigned sandbox specimen with fictional data, not an approved customer form, legal certification, audited report, signature or payment evidence. Approved institution details, source facts, product terms and jurisdiction wording require their own governed revision and authorization.</div>
</section>
